#: bp-job-manager.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"This plugin integrates WordPress Job Manager with BuddyPress. Allows the "
"members to post jobs, and others to apply for those posted jobs."
msgstr ""
"Ce plugin intègre WordPress Job Manager avec BuddyPress. Il permet aux "
"membres de publier des offres d'emploi et aux autres de postuler pour ces "
"offres."

